  def get(value); end

  # **Parameters**
  #
  # - `lazy_class` (`Class`) — A class which represents a lazy value (subclasses may also be used)
  # - `lazy_value_method` (`Symbol`) — The method to call on this class to get its value
  #
  # :call-seq:
