# See [Schema::Member::TypeSystemHelpers#to_list_type](rdoc-ref:Schema::Member::TypeSystemHelpers#to_list_type) Create a list type from another GraphQL type
#
# source://graphql//lib/graphql/schema/list.rb#10
class GraphQL::Schema::List < ::GraphQL::Schema::Wrapper
  include ::GraphQL::Schema::Member::ValidatesInput

  # @return [Boolean]
